;; The profile anyone in this repository gets unless one names them.
;;
;; THIS FILE IS A DESCRIPTION, NOT AN AUTHORITY (ADR-2609061200). It cannot
;; grant a tool, an account, a workspace or an approval: those keys are not in
;; the vocabulary and writing one refuses the whole file by name.
;;
;; `:profile/id` names a bot that must exist AT THE DESTINATION. Until one
;; does, `itonami chat` here refuses with `hermes/not-found` — the intended
;; fail-closed behaviour, not a fallback to somebody else's bot — while
;; `itonami profile explain` still works and says so.
;;
;; To add a second person: one more file beside this one with
;; `:profile/for "<their local identity>"`. They match it by setting
;; ITONAMI_PROFILE_AS or `:profile {:as …}` in their own install's config;
;; nothing in this repository decides who anyone is.
{:profile/schema "cloud.itonami.app.repo-profile.v1"
 :profile/id "kuro"
 :profile/default? true
 :bot/name "kuro"
 :bot/brief "あなたは kotoba-lang/kuro の現在地を測る。端末 session の data contract。"
 :bot/context-refs [{:kind "repo" :target "kotoba-lang/kuro"}]}
